    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but it's more than just grief. it's like this constant feeling that i'm an intruder in my own life. everyone around me is so kind and trying to help, but they're just pouring energy into a hole that can't be filled. i feel like a debt that's never gonna be paid back. it's just math, you know? i'm taking up space and resources that would be better spent elsewhere.",
